{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a blue hat and a black remote. The remote is placed below the hat, and both are aligned vertically. For every pizza in the image, it is positioned below the remote, and there is a white calculator located directly below the pizza. All objects maintain a strict vertical alignment.",
